{"content_hash": "28acb13fa7489400", "version_id": 904, "article_id": 91, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "A reporter let AI shop for Double 11 and the headphones went wrong", "title_zh": "记者把双十一购物交给AI，结果耳机环节翻车了", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8196807.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1657049016607-0a376708752f?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8aGVscGVycyUyMGZhaWwlMjBmaW5kfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQwOTkwNzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Steve Lieman on Unsplash", "author": "Steve Lieman", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@stevelieman?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-little-girl-playing-in-the-grass-XeFzJmAjRxY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(27, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(65, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "0183c75384c8"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-08", "word_count": 273, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "A Chinese tech writer handed his Double 11 shopping list to the AI assistants built into Taobao, JD.com and Douyin. The price hunting mostly worked, but the product checks exposed a gap between what the bots warn about and what they recommend.", "lead_zh": "一位中国科技作者把双十一购物清单交给了淘宝、京东和抖音自带的AI助手。比价基本管用，但商品核对暴露出一个问题：AI提醒你小心的东西，和它自己推荐的东西，往往对不上。", "preview": "Double 11 started in mid-October this year, so the writer decided to test a new approach: letting each platform's own AI do the buying. He p", "preview_zh": "今年双十一从十月中旬就开始了，于是这位作者决定试试新玩法：让各平台自带的AI替他买东西。他挑了三样商品，包括银色iPhone 17 Pro 256GB和AirPods Pro 3，把同样的问题分别发给淘宝AI、京东京言和抖音豆包。在此之前，他手动搜了一遍，发现标价很容易误导人，因", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 887, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 118.925, "size_bytes": 714528, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 121.65, "size_bytes": 730800, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 128.975, "size_bytes": 774864, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 112.15, "size_bytes": 673920, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 121.55, "size_bytes": 730224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 312, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@cf016b9/content/data/versions/904.json", "paragraphs": ["Double 11 started in mid-October this year, so the writer decided to test a new approach: letting each platform's own AI do the buying. He picked four items, including an iPhone 17 Pro 256GB in silver and AirPods Pro 3, and sent the same question to Taobao's AI, JD.com's Jingyan and Douyin's Doubao. Before that, he searched manually and found that listed prices can be misleading, because activated phones, refurbished units and second-hand goods are mixed in with new stock.", "The three assistants gave different answers, but every price they quoted could be found on a real product page. Doubao was fast and even offered to split orders to reach discount thresholds, though its total was slightly off. Jingyan read product details closely and flagged a suspicious 588 yuan headphone listing as possible false advertising. Taobao's AI explained the difference between refurbished and unopened phones, which the writer found useful.", "A separate tool called Lingguang 2.0, from Ant Group, worked differently. Instead of answering once, it tracked the iPhone price across four platforms and sent alerts. It reported a JD.com self-run price of about 7,458 yuan, then later recalculated to about 7,259 yuan after the listing dropped, and it reminded the buyer to claim a price guarantee. That saved roughly 740 yuan against the 7,999 yuan page price.", "The headphones, however, revealed a real problem. Taobao's AI recommended a store whose listing showed non-official model names, while Jingyan suggested a 1,428 yuan item labelled as an Apple refurbished unit and a 1,188.84 yuan offer that could not be shipped to the buyer's region. The prices were real, but the recommendations were not reliable."], "paragraphs_zh": ["今年双十一从十月中旬就开始了，于是这位作者决定试试新玩法：让各平台自带的AI替他买东西。他挑了三样商品，包括银色iPhone 17 Pro 256GB和AirPods Pro 3，把同样的问题分别发给淘宝AI、京东京言和抖音豆包。在此之前，他手动搜了一遍，发现标价很容易误导人，因为激活机、翻新机和二手货都混在全新货里。", "三个助手的回答各不相同，但它们报出的每个价格都能在真实商品页上找到。豆包反应快，还主动提出拆单凑满减，只是总价算得差了一点。京言仔细读了商品参数，把一个588元耳机的可疑链接标为可能虚假宣传。淘宝AI则解释了资源机和原封机的区别，作者觉得这点很有用。", "蚂蚁集团的另一款工具“灵光2.0”玩法不同。它不是答一次就完，而是跨四个平台跟踪iPhone价格并推送提醒。它先报出京东自营到手价约7458元，后来商品页面降价，又重新算出约7259元，还提醒买家申请价保。相比7999元的页面价，这大约省了740元。", "但耳机这一环节暴露了真正的问题。淘宝AI推荐的店铺页面上出现了非官方型号命名，京言则推荐了一款标着“Apple资源机”的1428元商品，以及一个当前地区无法发货的1188.84元报价。价格都是真的，但推荐并不可靠。正如作者所说，推荐资源机没问题，把资源机说成全新才有问题。"], "body": "Double 11 started in mid-October this year, so the writer decided to test a new approach: letting each platform's own AI do the buying. He picked four items, including an iPhone 17 Pro 256GB in silver and AirPods Pro 3, and sent the same question to Taobao's AI, JD.com's Jingyan and Douyin's Doubao. Before that, he searched manually and found that listed prices can be misleading, because activated phones, refurbished units and second-hand goods are mixed in with new stock.\n\nThe three assistants gave different answers, but every price they quoted could be found on a real product page. Doubao was fast and even offered to split orders to reach discount thresholds, though its total was slightly off. Jingyan read product details closely and flagged a suspicious 588 yuan headphone listing as possible false advertising. Taobao's AI explained the difference between refurbished and unopened phones, which the writer found useful.\n\nA separate tool called Lingguang 2.0, from Ant Group, worked differently. Instead of answering once, it tracked the iPhone price across four platforms and sent alerts. It reported a JD.com self-run price of about 7,458 yuan, then later recalculated to about 7,259 yuan after the listing dropped, and it reminded the buyer to claim a price guarantee. That saved roughly 740 yuan against the 7,999 yuan page price.\n\nThe headphones, however, revealed a real problem. Taobao's AI recommended a store whose listing showed non-official model names, while Jingyan suggested a 1,428 yuan item labelled as an Apple refurbished unit and a 1,188.84 yuan offer that could not be shipped to the buyer's region. The prices were real, but the recommendations were not reliable.", "body_zh": "今年双十一从十月中旬就开始了，于是这位作者决定试试新玩法：让各平台自带的AI替他买东西。他挑了三样商品，包括银色iPhone 17 Pro 256GB和AirPods Pro 3，把同样的问题分别发给淘宝AI、京东京言和抖音豆包。在此之前，他手动搜了一遍，发现标价很容易误导人，因为激活机、翻新机和二手货都混在全新货里。\n\n三个助手的回答各不相同，但它们报出的每个价格都能在真实商品页上找到。豆包反应快，还主动提出拆单凑满减，只是总价算得差了一点。京言仔细读了商品参数，把一个588元耳机的可疑链接标为可能虚假宣传。淘宝AI则解释了资源机和原封机的区别，作者觉得这点很有用。\n\n蚂蚁集团的另一款工具“灵光2.0”玩法不同。它不是答一次就完，而是跨四个平台跟踪iPhone价格并推送提醒。它先报出京东自营到手价约7458元，后来商品页面降价，又重新算出约7259元，还提醒买家申请价保。相比7999元的页面价，这大约省了740元。\n\n但耳机这一环节暴露了真正的问题。淘宝AI推荐的店铺页面上出现了非官方型号命名，京言则推荐了一款标着“Apple资源机”的1428元商品，以及一个当前地区无法发货的1188.84元报价。价格都是真的，但推荐并不可靠。正如作者所说，推荐资源机没问题，把资源机说成全新才有问题。", "text": "Double 11 started in mid-October this year, so the writer decided to test a new approach: letting each platform's own AI do the buying. He picked four items, including an iPhone 17 Pro 256GB in silver and AirPods Pro 3, and sent the same question to Taobao's AI, JD.com's Jingyan and Douyin's Doubao. Before that, he searched manually and found that listed prices can be misleading, because activated phones, refurbished units and second-hand goods are mixed in with new stock. The three assistants gave different answers, but every price they quoted could be found on a real product page. Doubao was fast and even offered to split orders to reach discount thresholds, though its total was slightly off. Jingyan read product details closely and flagged a suspicious 588 yuan headphone listing as possible false advertising. Taobao's AI explained the difference between refurbished and unopened phones, which the writer found useful. A separate tool called Lingguang 2.0, from Ant Group, worked differently. Instead of answering once, it tracked the iPhone price across four platforms and sent alerts. It reported a JD.com self-run price of about 7,458 yuan, then later recalculated to about 7,259 yuan after the listing dropped, and it reminded the buyer to claim a price guarantee. That saved roughly 740 yuan against the 7,999 yuan page price. The headphones, however, revealed a real problem. Taobao's AI recommended a store whose listing showed non-official model names, while Jingyan suggested a 1,428 yuan item labelled as an Apple refurbished unit and a 1,188.84 yuan offer that could not be shipped to the buyer's region. The prices were real, but the recommendations were not reliable.", "vocab": [{"word": "refurbished", "pos": "adj", "zh": "翻新的", "note": "常指官方或第三方翻新后重新出售的电子产品", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "listing", "pos": "noun", "zh": "商品链接；上架信息", "note": "电商语境中指一条商品页面", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "flag", "pos": "verb", "zh": "标记；指出", "note": "flag something as suspicious 表示标为可疑", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "suspicious", "pos": "adj", "zh": "可疑的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "threshold", "pos": "noun", "zh": "门槛；满减门槛", "note": "reach a discount threshold 达到满减门槛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "price guarantee", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "价保", "note": "买后降价可申请退差价", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "recalculate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重新计算", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "recommendation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "推荐", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reliable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "可靠的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "misleading", "pos": "adj", "zh": "误导性的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "activated", "pos": "adj", "zh": "已激活的", "note": "激活机保修已开始，价格更低", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "assistant", "pos": "noun", "zh": "助手", "note": "此处指AI助手", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-08T00:50:52.639974", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Double", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.575, "sm": 300, "em": 574, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "11", "s": 0.575, "e": 1.062, "sm": 575, "em": 1062, "cs": 7, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "started", "s": 1.062, "e": 1.438, "sm": 1062, "em": 1437, "cs": 10, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "in", "s": 1.438, "e": 1.512, "sm": 1437, "em": 1512, "cs": 18, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "mid-October", "s": 1.512, "e": 2.175, "sm": 1512, "em": 2174, "cs": 21, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "this", "s": 2.175, "e": 2.375, "sm": 2175, "em": 2375, "cs": 33, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "year", "s": 2.375, "e": 2.875, "sm": 2375, "em": 2875, "cs": 38, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ",", "s": 2.875, "e": 3.0, "sm": 2875, "em": 3000, "cs": 42, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "so", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.138, "sm": 3000, "em": 3137, "cs": 44, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": 